cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the qda.md format, please cite its specification as below."
title: "Specification of the qda.md format (version 1)"
version: "1 (draft 0.2)"
date-released: "2026-11-26"
license: EUPL-1.2
authors:
  - family-names: "Lits"
    given-names: "Grégoire"
    affiliation: "UCLouvain, Institut Langage et Communication, Media Innovation and Intelligibility Lab (MiiL)"
abstract: >-
  Specification of an open, plain-text Markdown file format for qualitative
  coding projects: texts, code tree, codings, memos, consensus decisions and
  the history of the coding frame. A project is stored either in a single
  .qda.md file or in a folder (an arbre.md file and one file per document).
  It is readable by people, editable in Obsidian and parsable by software.
keywords:
  - qualitative analysis
  - CAQDAS
  - coding
  - file format
  - Markdown
  - interoperability
  - archiving
  - open science
